     3189     tt-fin-doc.obj-type = X_clients-obj.obj-type
     3190     tt-fin-doc.obj-code = X_clients-obj.obj-code
     3191     .
     3192   display
     3193     tt-fin-doc.obj-type
     3194     tt-fin-doc.obj-code
     3195     with frame Dialog-Frame.
     3196   run check-obj in this-procedure (  input tt-fin-doc.obj-type
     3197     ,input tt-fin-doc.obj-code
     3198     )
     3199     no-error.
     3200   END.
     3201   ON LEAVE OF tt-fin-doc.obj-code IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
